    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so unfair. i feel like half of my soul died with them. i'm just walking around this world like a ghost, but i'm still breathing while they aren't. it doesn't make any sense for me to be here alone. it's like i'm supposed to be with them, but the world won't let me. i just want to be where they are.",
